Guns/materiel - small, giving the appeal of a minigame lacking depth
Hit rates - *Could be better* fortunately for the devs, some imbeciles don't notice this
Community - Can't be controlled but shown a lack of coherence. If the game aims to have teamwork with squad leaders, radio roles and machine gunners then why is
most a 'one-gun and runner'?
Large playerbase for MP;
